Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.93,0:00:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.09,0:01:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I work hard my whole life,\Nand then this happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.33,0:01:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.09,0:01:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm going to be late for school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.09,0:01:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.99,0:01:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.71,0:01:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.01,0:01:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it going, Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.73,0:01:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.64,0:01:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Moto, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.95,0:01:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Good for you, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.99,0:01:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What's bugging your grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.75,0:01:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen him like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.51,0:01:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.42,0:01:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so, but I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.85,0:01:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been acting really weird all morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.69,0:01:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.60,0:01:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm going to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.35,0:01:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I've endured many things in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.89,0:01:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been trapped in an ancient pyramid,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.89,0:01:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,stung by scorpions, attacked by Tibetan\Nwolves, but nothing compares to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.77,0:01:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,A new game shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.75,0:01:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a new game shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.35,0:01:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They think they can drive me out of\Nbusiness selling their trendy new trash,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.11,0:01:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but they have no respect\Nfor the gaming traditions,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.87,0:01:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the true classics, because they\Nsell only the fads of today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.21,0:01:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, a new game store?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.59,0:01:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I better go check out the competition\Nand see what we're up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.81,0:02:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.37,0:02:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, if your grandfather finds out we've\Nbeen here, you're going to be so grounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.63,0:02:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what's the harm in a\Nlittle window shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.21,0:02:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.69,0:02:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Dungeon dice monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.03,0:02:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, this looks like a pretty cool\Ngame, but I wonder how you play it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.77,0:02:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.67,0:02:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to make me\Nmiss my first class again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.59,0:02:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke, look, it's that Yugi Moto fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.79,0:02:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard to believe a pipsqueak like that\Ncould defeat the great Pegasus, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.59,0:02:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A cheater can win any game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.53,0:02:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So, that spiky-haired runt is\Nthe Duel Monster's champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.45,0:02:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't believe he's the only one\Nwho ever beat Pegasus at his own game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.85,0:02:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, if I get detention for this, you're\Ngonna have to do my homework for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.71,0:02:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, he'd never be able to beat the\Neven greater Duke Devlin at his own game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.69,0:02:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Duke?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.79,0:02:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The die is cast, the trap is set, and\Nsoon I will duel Yugi on my battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.31,0:02:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll strip him of his honor and expose to\Nthe world what that little worm really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.71,0:02:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nicely put.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.65,0:03:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But I really hope you know what you're\Ngetting into this time, Doogie Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.39,0:03:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I hired you to manage my new game shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.09,0:03:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Never to question me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.87,0:03:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If I play my cards right, and I always do,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.33,0:03:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,it is I who will be\Nthe next king of games.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.75,0:03:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're champ, that's when\Nthe money really pours in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.31,0:03:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Money is for greedy fools like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.11,0:03:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm after a much greater prize,\Nthe total destruction of Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.83,0:03:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, be still my beaten heart. You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.69,0:03:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a spanking new game shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.43,0:03:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, my grandpa's real worried about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It just opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.65,0:03:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got all the\Nlatest and greatest games.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They were really trying to hype this new\None, something about dice or dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.39,0:03:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You saying they got that\Ndungeon dice monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.13,0:03:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how did you become a\Ntotal expert all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.01,0:03:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A little thing called the newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.91,0:03:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever heard of it, genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.35,0:03:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.26,0:03:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You never read the newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.95,0:03:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I read them when I'm out\Ndelivering them, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.29,0:04:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you delivering newspapers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.43,0:04:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Taya, I don't get one\Nof them big, fat allowances.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.43,0:04:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need a little extra\Nspending money, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.99,0:04:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta save every penny of that award money\NYugi gave me for my sister's operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.53,0:04:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how is your sister Serenity doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.85,0:04:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, the eye guy says\Nshe's gonna see good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.49,0:04:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And the first thing she's\Ngonna see is my beautiful mug.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.13,0:04:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Joey, that's awesome news. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.81,0:04:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.33,0:04:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I missed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.61,0:04:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies, let's get this party started.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.11,0:04:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my gosh, here it goes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.91,0:04:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.25,0:04:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes on me, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.87,0:04:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.33,0:05:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two kids know who\Nthat Diceman is over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.85,0:05:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's Duke Devlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.45,0:05:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He owns that new game\Nshop that just opened up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.77,0:05:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's got it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.53,0:05:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, if there's one thing I can't stomach,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.63,0:05:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a guy who'll do anything\Nto get a girl's attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.01,0:05:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a filthy show-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And I just thought you couldn't stand guys
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.51,0:05:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,who were more popular\Nwith the girls than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.11,0:05:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.02,0:05:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, if I wanted, I\Ncould be just as popular,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.05,0:05:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't want to stoop to the\Nlevel of that two-bit Houdini.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.85,0:05:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I got my self-respect\Nand I got more talent
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.39,0:05:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,than my little pinky than he'll ever have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you count talking with\Nfood in your mouth of talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.57,0:05:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you catch any of my moves in\Nthe duelist kingdom, you numbskull?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.11,0:05:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're adding lucky\Nto your list of talents?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky I don't\Nrearrange your face, wise guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.19,0:05:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yugi, you gotta\Nback me up on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I was one of the best\Nduelists on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.77,0:05:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wish to intrude,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.17,0:05:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but I couldn't help overhearing\Nyou dabble in the game of dual
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.99,0:05:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters dabble smabble now\Nlisten up if you know the first
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.59,0:05:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,thing about dual monsters then\Nyou would know all about bandit
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.87,0:06:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,keith the intercontinental\Nchampion the guy was unbeatable
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.17,0:06:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and you should have seen me\Nwipe the floor with him good
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.23,0:06:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,thing joey's not a show-off i\Nguess modesty must be another
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.15,0:06:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,talent of joey's all right i'll\Nautograph a card for you what
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.61,0:06:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,have we here are you yugi moto\Nchampion of the duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.83,0:06:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've heard a great deal about\Nthe way you play the game. Hey, dicey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.31,0:06:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you heard about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler? Nothing at all. But\Nwhy don't we play a little game and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.85,0:06:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,you can show these lovely ladies\Njust what you're made of my game?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This a cup and dice are all\Nwe need to play the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.07,0:06:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are your talents up to the challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.53,0:06:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,When I beat that dice dog those\Ngirls are gonna be cheering Joey
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.19,0:06:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Devlin, bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.15,0:06:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's rock and roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.43,0:06:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Using the power of my mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:07:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet I can move the dice into my\Nright hand without touching the cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.43,0:07:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Next you'll be telling me\Nyou can fly around a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.75,0:07:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you've got telekinesis, there's\Nno way you can do what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.73,0:07:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just plain impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.49,0:07:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't underestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the dice are already gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.35,0:07:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.26,0:07:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond your comprehension,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.25,0:07:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't you just look\Nunder it for yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.67,0:07:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wise guy, Joey? No, it's a\Ntrick. Huh, it's still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.97,0:07:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take that. I moved\Nthe dice into my right
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.55,0:07:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,hand and I never ever had to touch the cup
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.27,0:07:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,that makes me the winner\Nyou're nothing but
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.27,0:07:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,a dirty rotten con\Nartist if you were a real
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.91,0:07:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,man you'd play a real game I challenge you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.65,0:07:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,to a match of dual\Nmonsters as you wish but
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.05,0:07:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,since this game is your\Nspecialty i do have
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.59,0:07:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,one very small condition\Ncondition okay but
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.19,0:07:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,no more funny stuff capiche i'm afraid i
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.39,0:07:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,don't have a deck of\Nmy own oh that's not my
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.67,0:08:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,problem you're the one\Nwith the new card job
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.21,0:08:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,my condition is this we\Nopen up new packs and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.03,0:08:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,create our own new dual monster decks that's\Nfair even by your high standards what's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.79,0:08:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,fair about that if you're not playing with
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.71,0:08:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,your own cards then the\Ngame's just pure luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.25,0:08:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, there's an awful lot of cards\Nthat we've never even seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.75,0:08:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a little faith, pal of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.47,0:08:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Was I or was I not a finalist in\Nthe Duel Monsters Championship?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Joey, but I don't think I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.65,0:08:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept your condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.61,0:08:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.83,0:08:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But playing a game for fun
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.51,0:08:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,is so pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make a little wager.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.81,0:08:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If I win, you'll do whatever\NI ask for an entire week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.71,0:08:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, dicey boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.69,0:08:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Because when I win, you're gonna\Nhave to do whatever I want you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And I want you to close down your\Nstinking shop. Forget about it. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.65,0:08:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,way i can lose to that show off he's\Ntoast burnt to a crisp yeah looks
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.55,0:08:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,like joey's getting in over his\Nhead again you can't seriously think
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.71,0:08:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm gonna lose to a guy with a dye\Nstuck in his ear i'm one of the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.87,0:09:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,top ranked players in the whole\Nworld i'm not some snotty nose rookie
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.29,0:09:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,who just brought home his first deck\Nyou're good joey but but nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.31,0:09:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,i know what i'm doing very well\Nwe'll hold the match today after
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.27,0:09:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,School, I have a state-of-the-art dueling\Nring located in my game shop. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.39,0:09:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.30,0:09:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, you're all invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.57,0:09:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want you to miss\Nyour friend's finest hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.39,0:09:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I think this isn't gonna end well?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.67,0:09:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that\Ndice guy owns this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.93,0:09:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's spent some major moolah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.29,0:09:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad he's gonna be closing it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.23,0:09:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's heart's in the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.77,0:09:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's his head I'm worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.01,0:09:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.92,0:09:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,if his head gets any bigger\Nhe's gonna get it stuck in
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.71,0:09:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,the front door i'm bad you\Nknow it i'm bad i'll show it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.13,0:09:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,welcome to duke devlin's\Ngame world mr devlin
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.03,0:09:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,was beginning to worry about you follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.49,0:10:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,ah you showed up the dueling ring is on\Nsub level six your chariot awaits go ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.55,0:10:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,mr wheeler choose your packs carefully we'll\Nbuild our own decks from these new cars
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.51,0:10:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.01,0:10:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Which pack is the best?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.53,0:10:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta feel the energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.57,0:10:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.75,0:10:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.71,0:10:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a load of these babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.93,0:10:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey struck gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.77,0:10:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get some good cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.71,0:10:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.15,0:10:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This match is in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.65,0:10:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.13,0:10:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.99,0:10:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.25,0:10:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.41,0:10:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.32,0:10:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,this is the smallest ring in the place, but\Nit does have all the bells and whistles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.09,0:10:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.00,0:10:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.91,0:10:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's our man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.83,0:10:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If he can't do it, nobody can! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.95,0:10:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, camera one in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,TV cameras?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.05,0:10:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.96,0:10:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a little theory that the bigger\Nthe audience, the better the performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.55,0:10:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I've decided to broadcast\Nthis match live to the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.45,0:11:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I know my fans will enjoy watching\Nme defeat the second-best duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.67,0:11:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope you really are\Nsecond-best, not second-rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.51,0:11:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Second-rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.33,0:11:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Second-rate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.25,0:11:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna need a second life!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.33,0:11:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Because when I'm through with you,\NDookie, there won't be anything left!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.17,0:11:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.33,0:11:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never disappointed my loyal\Nfans yet. Duke! Duke! He's our man!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.57,0:11:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If he can't do it, nobody can!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.33,0:11:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.15,0:11:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's our man! Clam up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.07,0:11:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get this show on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.03,0:11:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.89,0:11:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the duel begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.35,0:11:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,C-U-K-E.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.93,0:11:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke's the only one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Deuce's name, he's got game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.15,0:11:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler is so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.67,0:11:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,For my first move, I'll attack with...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.11,0:11:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oni Tank, T-34. Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.95,0:12:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, that ends my first move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.39,0:12:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see some of that\Nworld-class talent of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.55,0:12:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on to your headband, dicey boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.89,0:12:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.99,0:12:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This card's got a power-up effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.27,0:12:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Every monster my guy destroys\Nbecomes part of his armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.89,0:12:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.57,0:12:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sword hunter in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.71,0:12:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's slice and dice the Diceman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.79,0:12:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Slam in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.09,0:12:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Bada bing, bada boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.35,0:12:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your big bad Oni tank's changing\Ninto a chunk of Sword Hunter's armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.85,0:12:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,raising his attack power\Nby a whopping 200 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.15,0:12:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.21,0:12:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Joey won't embarrass\Nhimself after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.31,0:12:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Think he's got a shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.53,0:12:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.47,0:12:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Duke Devlin, why don't you quit before\Nmy sword guy messes up your pretty hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.15,0:12:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you just where\NI want you. Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.37,0:12:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You crack me up, pukey boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.73,0:13:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But, hey, it's your funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.45,0:13:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this will come in handy later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.87,0:13:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Dark Bat in defensive mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.17,0:13:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And I lay another card face down as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.55,0:13:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A bat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.91,0:13:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the best you've got,\Nyou're saying bye-bye card shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.67,0:13:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mad Sword Beast in attack\Nmode, coming at ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.35,0:13:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,ATTACK!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.61,0:13:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No harm done, as the bat\Nwas in defensive mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.21,0:13:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where you're wrong, Ponytail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.23,0:13:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mad Sword Beast\Nreduces your life points
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.45,0:13:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,even if your stinking\Nbat was in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.47,0:13:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I've underestimated you\NBut my dark bat won't be going
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.05,0:13:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Off to the graveyard all by himself.\NThanks to Michizuri, Michi, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.37,0:13:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The Michizuri monster will\Ndrag you to your doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.25,0:14:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.16,0:14:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,that hurt Joey better start thinking more\Nthan one move ahead Don't get too cocky,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.53,0:14:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Like I said before,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.53,0:14:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I got this match here\Nin a bag I could beat
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.51,0:14:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,this two-bit loser even\Nin my sleep I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Duke Devlin knows more about\Nthis game than he's letting on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.23,0:14:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Joey doesn't blow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.43,0:14:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Think that little trick's\Ngonna save you, bony butt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.87,0:14:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.85,0:14:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I still got you where I want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.59,0:14:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.50,0:14:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Since your strongest monster\Nwent off to an early grade,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.47,0:14:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,now would be an excellent time\Nfor me to go on the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.95,0:14:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll play this card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.01,0:14:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.07,0:14:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I summon Spike Bot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.35,0:14:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,With Spike Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.13,0:14:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey, concentrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.43,0:14:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke Devlin's just\Ntrying to psych you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.51,0:14:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let that Joker get to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.29,0:14:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you lose, you're gonna have\Nto do whatever he tells you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.79,0:14:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you forget that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.47,0:14:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Fat chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.11,0:15:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Lady Luck, Joey needs a winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.51,0:15:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha-ching!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.49,0:15:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This super card's gonna kick\Nyour spiky bot's keyster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.25,0:15:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Goblin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.37,0:15:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack force! Bash him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.93,0:15:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have a snowball's\Nchance in Hades now, Duke Deadman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.89,0:15:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I forgot those goblin guys go\Ninto defensive mode after they attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.39,0:15:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No problemo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.79,0:15:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He's only got 50 points left anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.03,0:15:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And next turn, it's zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.89,0:15:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And then you're gonna close\Nyour shot down for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.69,0:15:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's really gonna win and\Nmake your Grandpa so happy. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.23,0:15:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You got him now, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.97,0:15:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How can Duke Devlin still be so calm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.75,0:15:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Either he's got ice in his blood, or he's\Nstill got one last trick up his sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.09,0:15:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be careful! It's not over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.39,0:16:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Those girls are gonna be\Ncheering for Joey now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.27,0:16:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We love Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.77,0:16:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't watch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.51,0:16:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough fooling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.03,0:16:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to summon one of the most\Npowerful cards in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.03,0:16:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mighty Cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.79,0:16:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That all you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.27,0:16:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that won't save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.15,0:16:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And I use a magic card, Limiter\NRemoval, which doubles my attack power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.65,0:16:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy cannoli, that's a lot of points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.73,0:16:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing I got all my goblins, or\Nhe'd beat me with one lousy shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.33,0:16:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, another magic\Ncard, Fairy Meteor Crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.49,0:16:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.85,0:16:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.76,0:16:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I never heard of that fairy card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.27,0:16:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.18,0:16:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me the second-best duelist\Ndoesn't know what this card does.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.29,0:16:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you might say it's a magic card\Nversion of the Mad Sword Beast card you play.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.75,0:16:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mad Sword Beast. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.83,0:16:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.91,0:16:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This card has a special power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.23,0:17:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Usually, your monster in defensive\Nmode would absorb my attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.65,0:17:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But with the Fairy Meteor Crush card,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.83,0:17:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can deal my damage directly\Nto your precious life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.93,0:17:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.87,0:17:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pity this match was so short.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.31,0:17:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping for an actual challenge,\Nbut it was not meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.85,0:17:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing that cheers\Nme up is knowing that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.63,0:17:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll soon become my\Nservant for an entire week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.61,0:17:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.31,0:17:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Cards, annihilate!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.81,0:17:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He wiped out all of Joey's goblins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.51,0:17:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And the rest of his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.97,0:17:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the cool, stablin' rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.13,0:17:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the master of all jewels.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.47,0:17:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.85,0:17:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You did your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.23,0:17:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Put it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.87,0:18:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that you're a man\Nof your word, Joey boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.69,0:18:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to having an\Nobedient dog for the next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.77,0:18:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.37,0:18:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was in the duelist kingdom,\NI never made a mistake like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.69,0:18:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a purpose then,\Nfighting for my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.55,0:18:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I guess I've just gone to the dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.19,0:18:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, knock it off, Duke Devlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.87,0:18:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because you won doesn't\Nmean you can put Joey down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.33,0:18:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, a promise is a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.27,0:18:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And I gotta keep it even if it's\Nto a creep like that Devlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.99,0:18:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.95,0:18:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your yap, you mongrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.03,0:18:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not speak until\Nyour master commands you to!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.29,0:18:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey, let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.87,0:18:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys, I gave my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.29,0:18:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a dog now, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.97,0:18:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't say ouch, you say woof woof.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.97,0:18:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, woof woof.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.75,0:18:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, now put it on and bark for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.67,0:18:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bark, dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.01,0:18:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch him bark! Play the fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.95,0:18:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Dog Boy Joey's not so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.33,0:19:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The dog suit fits you perfectly, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.51,0:19:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now give us your best bark.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.23,0:19:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Woof, woof.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.37,0:19:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy, Joey. Enough, man. Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.83,0:19:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to put a stop to this. Yuge!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.07,0:19:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke Devlin, your cruel stunt\Nhas gone on long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.53,0:19:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I challenge you to a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.69,0:19:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I have defeated you, you will\Ndeclare Joey a free man again. Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.55,0:19:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But we will play a game\Nof my own choosing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.21,0:19:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We will battle to the finish in a\Ngame called Dungeon Dice Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.83,0:19:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you are the loser, you will\Ngive the title King of Games to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.37,0:19:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And you will swear on your grandfather's\Nlife never to play Duel Monsters again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.65,0:19:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That is going too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.59,0:19:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Yugi, you've got too much to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.65,0:19:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This is completely crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.09,0:19:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.69,0:19:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop your gapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.95,0:20:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's it gonna be, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke, I will accept your conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.55,0:20:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not let you destroy\Nthe dignity of a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.83,0:20:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We will do battle in your game\Nof choice, Dungeon Dice Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.55,0:20:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are worth all the titles\Nand all the games in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.51,0:20:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stick by them no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.49,0:20:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's something Duke Devlin\Nwill never understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.03,0:20:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to take him on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.49,0:20:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,For Joey's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.91,0:20:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You've fallen into my trap, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.13,0:20:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My Dungeon Dice Monsters will destroy you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.87,0:20:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You
